**Webhook URL** ("—" = webhook disabled):
{webhook_url}

Any device that calls an HTTP address when the button is pressed works, e.g. Shelly Gen1 ("I/O URL actions"), Shelly Gen2 and newer ("Actions" or "Webhooks"), ESPHome (http_request) or Tasmota (WebSend). HTTP on the local network only; the webhook cannot be reached from the internet.
